 "intro_zh": "黄鹤楼是武汉市标志性建筑，与晴川阁、古琴台并称“武汉三大名胜”，还建筑与湖南岳阳楼、江西南昌滕王阁并称为“江南三大名楼”，整个建筑具有独特的民族风格，散发出中国传统文化的精神、气质、神韵。",
 "intro_en": "The Yellow Crane Tower is a landmark building in Wuhan. Together with Qingchuan Pavilion and Guqintai, it is known as one of the \"Three Famous Scenic Spots in Wuhan.\" It is also known as the \"Three Famous Towers in Jiangnan\" along with the Yueyang Tower in Hunan and the Tengwang Pavilion in Nanchang, Jiangxi. The entire building has a unique national style, exuding the spirit, temperament, and charm of traditional Chinese culture.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
